# Solution Architecture

## Business Workflow

```text
SAP HANA ERP
      │
      ▼
Data Extraction Layer
      │
      ▼
Data Consolidation & ETL
      │
      ▼
Feature Engineering
      │
      ▼
Forecasting Engine
      │
      ├── Store-Level Forecasting
      │
      ├── Product Group Forecasting
      │
      └── Mirror Store Forecasting
      ▼
Business Rules Engine
      │
      ▼
Forecast Outputs
      │
      ▼
Power BI Dashboards
      │
      ▼
Commercial Planning
Inventory Planning
Budgeting
Store Expansion Decisions
```

## Core Capabilities

### Sales Forecasting

Forecasting future sales using historical transactional data and machine learning methodologies.

### Store Expansion Planning

Mirror Store methodology for estimating expected performance of new retail locations.

### Product Group Analytics

Demand forecasting at category level to support operational planning.

### Executive Dashboards

Power BI reporting layer designed for commercial and strategic decision making.
